{:trait/id :trait-kor-rapid-modernization, :trait/kind :value-system, :trait/region [:region/id "KOR"], :trait/title "Rapid modernization & tech-driven identity", :trait/description "South Korea transformed from agricultural poverty (1960s) to tech powerhouse (Samsung, LG, Hyundai). National identity intertwined with rapid development, tech innovation, global competitiveness. Future orientation & ambition drive culture.", :trait/contrast "CONTRAST to slower-paced societies: Korean culture valorizes speed & efficiency.", :trait/confidence :high, :trait/source "Castells (1989) 'Informational City'", :trait/caveat "Rapid modernization creates generational gaps & burnout. Work-life balance crises common. Mental health challenges rising. Individual variation by exposure to traditional vs. modern values."}
